CORE
main.c
--32 --little-endian --unwind 13
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Byte updates of 12 and 6 bytes at a non-constant offset into an array of
non-constant size. Each element update is given only a window of the update
value (two elements wide); this checks that every element still receives the
right bytes, including the first element and the partial last one.
